; text-align: inherit;">בְּתוֹךְ יְרוּשָׁלַֽיִם עִֽירְךָ כַּאֲשֶׁר דִּבַּֽרְתָּ, וְכִסֵּא דָוִד עַבְדְּךָ מְהֵרָה בְּתוֹכָהּ תָּכִין, וּבְנֵה אוֹתָהּ בִּנְיַן עוֹלָם בִּמְהֵרָה בְיָמֵֽינוּ: בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יֻהֻוֻהֻ, בּוֹנֵה יְרוּשָׁלָיִם:</span></div></div></span></div></div></span></span><span style="font-size: 24pt;"><span class="rangeSpan"><div tabindex="0" class="segment showNamedEntityLinks" data-ref="Siddur Edot HaMizrach, Weekday Shacharit, The Shema 3" aria-controls="panel-1" aria-label="Click to see links to Siddur Edot HaMizrach, Weekday Shacharit, The Shema 3"><div dir="rtl"><span class="rangeSpan"><div tabindex="0" class="segment highlight invisibleHighlight showNamedEntityLinks" data-ref="Siddur Edot HaMizrach, Weekday Shacharit, Amida 28" aria-controls="panel-1" aria-label="Click to see links to Siddur Edot HaMizrach, Weekday Shacharit, Amida 28">​<div dir="rtl"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;"><strong>אֶת</strong></span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;"><strong class="currentStartMark"> צֶֽמַח&nbsp;</strong></span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 18pt; background-color: unset; text-align: inherit;">דָּוִד עַבְדְּךָ מְהֵרָה תַצְמִֽיחַ, וְקַרְנוֹ תָּרוּם בִּישֽׁוּעָתֶֽךָ, כִּי לִֽישׁוּעָֽתְךָ קִוִּֽינוּ כָּל־הַיּוֹם: בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יִהִוִהִ, מַצְמִֽיחַ קֶֽרֶן יְשׁוּעָה:</span></div></div></span></div></div></span></span><span style="font-size: 24pt;"><span class="rangeSpan"><div tabindex="0" class="segment showNamedEntityLinks" data-ref="Siddur Edot HaMizrach, Weekday Shacharit, The Shema 3" aria-controls="panel-1" aria-label="Click to see links to Siddur Edot HaMizrach, Weekday Shacharit, The Shema 3"><div dir="rtl"><span class="rangeSpan"><div tabindex="0" class="segment highlight invisibleHighlight showNamedEntityLinks" data-ref="Siddur Edot HaMizrach, Weekday Shacharit, Amida 29" aria-controls="panel-1" aria-label="Click to see li